<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<zabbix_export>
    <version>7.0</version>
    <template_groups>
        <template_group>
            <uuid>7df967e8653745039a47f97800c2830f</uuid>
            <name>Templates/Network devices</name>
        </template_group>
    </template_groups>
    <templates>
        <template>
            <uuid>a1b2c3d4e5f647890123456789abcdef</uuid>
            <template>Avaya G450 Media Gateway</template>
            <name>Avaya G450 Media Gateway</name>
            <description>Avaya G450 Media Gateway (G700-MG-MIB) monitoring template for Zabbix 7.0+.
Monitors hardware environment, PSU/Fan, H.248 registration, clock sync, and VoIP DSP channel usage.</description>
            <groups>
                <group>
                    <name>Templates/Network devices</name>
                </group>
            </groups>
            <items>
                <!-- 1. CPU Temperature -->
                <item>
                    <uuid>11111111111141111111111111111111</uuid>
                    <name>CPU Temperature</name>
                    <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                    <snmp_oid>1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.1.10.1.0</snmp_oid>
                    <key>cmgCpuTemp</key>
                    <delay>1m</delay>
                    <value_type>FLOAT</value_type>
                    <units>°C</units>
                    <description>G450 Main CPU Temperature (cmgCpuTemp).
【確認手順】高温アラート発生時は排気ファン状態 (`show environment`) および吸気口の閉塞を確認してください。</description>
                    <tags>
                        <tag><tag>component</tag><value>environment</value></tag>
                        <tag><tag>subsystem</tag><value>cpu</value></tag>
                    </tags>
                    <triggers>
                        <trigger>
                            <uuid>11111111111141111111111111111112</uuid>
                            <expression>last(/Avaya G450 Media Gateway/cmgCpuTemp)&gt;={$CPU_TEMP_WARN}</expression>
                            <name>G450: High CPU Temperature (&gt;={$CPU_TEMP_WARN}°C)</name>
                            <priority>WARNING</priority>
                        </trigger>
                    </triggers>
                </item>

                <!-- 2. DSP Temperature -->
                <item>
                    <uuid>22222222222242222222222222222222</uuid>
                    <name>DSP Temperature</name>
                    <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                    <snmp_oid>1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.1.10.4.0</snmp_oid>
                    <key>cmgDspTemp</key>
                    <delay>1m</delay>
                    <value_type>FLOAT</value_type>
                    <units>°C</units>
                    <description>G450 On-Board DSP Temperature (cmgDspTemp).
【影響】DSP過熱時はVoIP処理能力が低下、または熱保護によりDSPエンジンが自動シャットダウンする可能性があります。</description>
                    <tags>
                        <tag><tag>component</tag><value>environment</value></tag>
                        <tag><tag>subsystem</tag><value>dsp</value></tag>
                    </tags>
                    <triggers>
                        <trigger>
                            <uuid>22222222222242222222222222222223</uuid>
                            <expression>last(/Avaya G450 Media Gateway/cmgDspTemp)&gt;={$DSP_TEMP_WARN}</expression>
                            <name>G450: High DSP Temperature (&gt;={$DSP_TEMP_WARN}°C)</name>
                            <priority>WARNING</priority>
                        </trigger>
                    </triggers>
                </item>

                <!-- 3. CM Registration State -->
                <item>
                    <uuid>33333333333343333333333333333333</uuid>
                    <name>CM Registration State</name>
                    <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                    <snmp_oid>1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.3.1.0</snmp_oid>
                    <key>cmgRegistrationState</key>
                    <delay>30s</delay>
                    <value_type>UINT64</value_type>
                    <description>Communication Manager (CM) Registration Status (cmgRegistrationState).
・1: registered (正常)
・2: unregistered (未登録・切断)
・3: registering (登録試行中)

【影響】Unregisteredの場合、G450配下のIPT/回線が全滅またはLSPにフォールバックします。
【確認手順】G450 CLIにて `show mgc` を実行し、Active MGCへの到達性をご確認ください。</description>
                    <tags>
                        <tag><tag>component</tag><value>h248</value></tag>
                        <tag><tag>subsystem</tag><value>registration</value></tag>
                    </tags>
                    <triggers>
                        <trigger>
                            <uuid>33333333333343333333333333333334</uuid>
                            <expression>last(/Avaya G450 Media Gateway/cmgRegistrationState)&lt;&gt;1</expression>
                            <name>G450: Registration State Failed (Unregistered from CM)</name>
                            <priority>HIGH</priority>
                        </trigger>
                    </triggers>
                </item>

                <!-- 4. H.248 Link Status -->
                <item>
                    <uuid>44444444444444444444444444444444</uuid>
                    <name>H.248 Link Status</name>
                    <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                    <snmp_oid>1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.3.3.0</snmp_oid>
                    <key>cmgH248LinkStatus</key>
                    <delay>30s</delay>
                    <value_type>UINT64</value_type>
                    <description>H.248 Control Link Physical/Logical Status (cmgH248LinkStatus).
・1: up (正常)
・2: down (リンクダウン)</description>
                    <tags>
                        <tag><tag>component</tag><value>h248</value></tag>
                    </tags>
                    <triggers>
                        <trigger>
                            <uuid>44444444444444444444444444444445</uuid>
                            <expression>last(/Avaya G450 Media Gateway/cmgH248LinkStatus)=2</expression>
                            <name>G450: H.248 Link Status DOWN</name>
                            <priority>HIGH</priority>
                        </trigger>
                    </triggers>
                </item>

                <!-- 5. Active Clock Source -->
                <item>
                    <uuid>55555555555545555555555555555555</uuid>
                    <name>Active Clock Source</name>
                    <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                    <snmp_oid>1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.2.3.3.0</snmp_oid>
                    <key>cmgActiveClockSource</key>
                    <delay>1m</delay>
                    <value_type>UINT64</value_type>
                    <description>Active Synchronization Clock Source ID (cmgActiveClockSource).
【影響】クロック同期元が予期せず切替・消失した場合、PRI/BRIデジタル外線でノイズ、音声バッファエラー、FAX通信異常が発生します。
【確認手順】`show sync-clock` を実行し、プライマリ・セカンダリクロック状態を確認してください。</description>
                    <tags>
                        <tag><tag>component</tag><value>clock</value></tag>
                    </tags>
                    <triggers>
                        <trigger>
                            <uuid>55555555555545555555555555555556</uuid>
                            <expression>change(/Avaya G450 Media Gateway/cmgActiveClockSource)&lt;&gt;0</expression>
                            <name>G450: Active Clock Source Changed</name>
                            <priority>WARNING</priority>
                            <manual_close>YES</manual_close>
                        </trigger>
                    </triggers>
                </item>

                <!-- 6. Power Processor -->
                <item>
                    <uuid>66666666666646666666666666666666</uuid>
                    <name>Power Processor Status</name>
                    <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                    <snmp_oid>1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.1.10.7.0</snmp_oid>
                    <key>cmgPowerMgProcessor</key>
                    <delay>1m</delay>
                    <value_type>UINT64</value_type>
                    <description>Main Processor Subsystem Power Status (cmgPowerMgProcessor).
・1: normal (正常), 1以外: 障害発生</description>
                    <tags>
                        <tag><tag>component</tag><value>power</value></tag>
                    </tags>
                    <triggers>
                        <trigger>
                            <uuid>66666666666646666666666666666667</uuid>
                            <expression>last(/Avaya G450 Media Gateway/cmgPowerMgProcessor)&lt;&gt;1</expression>
                            <name>G450: Power Processor Failure</name>
                            <priority>HIGH</priority>
                        </trigger>
                    </triggers>
                </item>

                <!-- 7. Power Media Modules -->
                <item>
                    <uuid>77777777777747777777777777777777</uuid>
                    <name>Power Media Modules Status</name>
                    <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                    <snmp_oid>1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.1.10.8.0</snmp_oid>
                    <key>cmgPowerMediaModules</key>
                    <delay>1m</delay>
                    <value_type>UINT64</value_type>
                    <description>Media Modules Bus Power Status (cmgPowerMediaModules).
【影響】MM710, MM711, MM716等への給電に問題が発生している可能性があります。</description>
                    <tags>
                        <tag><tag>component</tag><value>power</value></tag>
                    </tags>
                    <triggers>
                        <trigger>
                            <uuid>77777777777747777777777777777778</uuid>
                            <expression>last(/Avaya G450 Media Gateway/cmgPowerMediaModules)&lt;&gt;1</expression>
                            <name>G450: Power Media Modules Failure</name>
                            <priority>HIGH</priority>
                        </trigger>
                    </triggers>
                </item>

                <!-- 8. Power VoIP Complex -->
                <item>
                    <uuid>88888888888848888888888888888888</uuid>
                    <name>Power VoIP Complex Status</name>
                    <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                    <snmp_oid>1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.1.10.9.0</snmp_oid>
                    <key>cmgPowerVoipComplex</key>
                    <delay>1m</delay>
                    <value_type>UINT64</value_type>
                    <description>VoIP Complex / DSP Engine Power Status (cmgPowerVoipComplex).
・1: normal, 1以外: DSP基板の電源系障害</description>
                    <tags>
                        <tag><tag>component</tag><value>power</value></tag>
                    </tags>
                    <triggers>
                        <trigger>
                            <uuid>88888888888848888888888888888889</uuid>
                            <expression>last(/Avaya G450 Media Gateway/cmgPowerVoipComplex)&lt;&gt;1</expression>
                            <name>G450: Power VoIP Complex Failure</name>
                            <priority>HIGH</priority>
                        </trigger>
                    </triggers>
                </item>

                <!-- 9. Fan Speed Level Alert -->
                <item>
                    <uuid>99999999999949999999999999999999</uuid>
                    <name>Fan Speed Level Alert</name>
                    <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                    <snmp_oid>1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.1.10.14.0</snmp_oid>
                    <key>cmgHardwareFanLowSpeedLevel</key>
                    <delay>1m</delay>
                    <value_type>UINT64</value_type>
                    <description>Fan Tray Low-Speed Level Alert (cmgHardwareFanLowSpeedLevel).
・1: normal (正常速度), 1以外: ファン異常・回転数低下低下アラート発生</description>
                    <tags>
                        <tag><tag>component</tag><value>environment</value></tag>
                        <tag><tag>subsystem</tag><value>fan</value></tag>
                    </tags>
                    <triggers>
                        <trigger>
                            <uuid>99999999999949999999999999999990</uuid>
                            <expression>last(/Avaya G450 Media Gateway/cmgHardwareFanLowSpeedLevel)&lt;&gt;1</expression>
                            <name>G450: Fan Speed Level Warning</name>
                            <priority>WARNING</priority>
                        </trigger>
                    </triggers>
                </item>

                <!-- 10. Current IP Address -->
                <item>
                    <uuid>aaaaaaaaaaaa4aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa</uuid>
                    <name>Current IP Address</name>
                    <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                    <snmp_oid>1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.2.1.4.0</snmp_oid>
                    <key>cmgCurrentIpAddress</key>
                    <delay>5m</delay>
                    <value_type>TEXT</value_type>
                    <description>Currently Active Gateway Management IP Address (cmgCurrentIpAddress).</description>
                    <tags>
                        <tag><tag>component</tag><value>network</value></tag>
                    </tags>
                    <triggers>
                        <trigger>
                            <uuid>aaaaaaaaaaaa4aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaab</uuid>
                            <expression>change(/Avaya G450 Media Gateway/cmgCurrentIpAddress)&lt;&gt;0</expression>
                            <name>G450: System IP Address Changed to {ITEM.VALUE}</name>
                            <priority>INFO</priority>
                            <manual_close>YES</manual_close>
                        </trigger>
                    </triggers>
                </item>

                <!-- 11. Model Number -->
                <item>
                    <uuid>bbbbbbbbbbbb4bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb</uuid>
                    <name>Model Number</name>
                    <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                    <snmp_oid>1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.1.2.0</snmp_oid>
                    <key>cmgModelNumber</key>
                    <delay>1h</delay>
                    <value_type>TEXT</value_type>
                    <description>Hardware Model Designation (e.g. G450, G700).</description>
                    <tags>
                        <tag><tag>component</tag><value>inventory</value></tag>
                    </tags>
                </item>

                <!-- 12. Serial Number -->
                <item>
                    <uuid>cccccccccccc4ccccccccccccccccccc</uuid>
                    <name>Serial Number</name>
                    <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                    <snmp_oid>1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.1.4.0</snmp_oid>
                    <key>cmgSerialNumber</key>
                    <delay>1h</delay>
                    <value_type>TEXT</value_type>
                    <description>G450 Main Chassis Serial Number (cmgSerialNumber).</description>
                    <tags>
                        <tag><tag>component</tag><value>inventory</value></tag>
                    </tags>
                </item>

                <!-- 13. Firmware Version -->
                <item>
                    <uuid>dddddddddddd4ddddddddddddddddddd</uuid>
                    <name>Firmware Version</name>
                    <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                    <snmp_oid>1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.2.1.3.0</snmp_oid>
                    <key>cmgFWVersion</key>
                    <delay>1h</delay>
                    <value_type>TEXT</value_type>
                    <description>G450 Gateway System Firmware Version (cmgFWVersion).</description>
                    <tags>
                        <tag><tag>component</tag><value>inventory</value></tag>
                    </tags>
                </item>
            </items>

            <!-- Low Level Discovery Rules -->
            <discovery_rules>
                <!-- LLD 1: Media Modules -->
                <discovery_rule>
                    <uuid>eeeeeeeeeeee4eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee</uuid>
                    <name>Media Module Discovery</name>
                    <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                    <snmp_oid>discovery[{#MODULE_SLOT},1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.1.11.1.1.1]</snmp_oid>
                    <key>cmgModuleTable.discovery</key>
                    <delay>1h</delay>
                    <item_prototypes>
                        <item_prototype>
                            <uuid>eeeeeeeeeeee4eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee1</uuid>
                            <name>Module Slot {#MODULE_SLOT} Description</name>
                            <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                            <snmp_oid>1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.1.11.1.1.3.{#MODULE_SLOT}</snmp_oid>
                            <key>cmgModuleDescription[{#MODULE_SLOT}]</key>
                            <delay>1h</delay>
                            <value_type>TEXT</value_type>
                            <description>Media Module Hardware Description (e.g., MM710 T1/E1, MM711 Analog, MM716 Analog).</description>
                            <tags>
                                <tag><tag>component</tag><value>module</value></tag>
                            </tags>
                        </item_prototype>
                        <item_prototype>
                            <uuid>eeeeeeeeeeee4eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee2</uuid>
                            <name>Module Slot {#MODULE_SLOT} Fault Mask</name>
                            <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                            <snmp_oid>1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.1.11.1.1.10.{#MODULE_SLOT}</snmp_oid>
                            <key>cmgModuleFaultMask[{#MODULE_SLOT}]</key>
                            <delay>1m</delay>
                            <value_type>TEXT</value_type>
                            <description>Fault Status Mask for Media Module in Slot {#MODULE_SLOT}.
"00 00 00 00" 以外の値が検出された場合、該当モジュールカードの障害を意味します。</description>
                            <tags>
                                <tag><tag>component</tag><value>module</value></tag>
                            </tags>
                            <trigger_prototypes>
                                <trigger_prototype>
                                    <uuid>eeeeeeeeeeee4eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee3</uuid>
                                    <expression>length(last(/Avaya G450 Media Gateway/cmgModuleFaultMask[{#MODULE_SLOT}]))&gt;0 and last(/Avaya G450 Media Gateway/cmgModuleFaultMask[{#MODULE_SLOT}])&lt;&gt;"00 00 00 00"</expression>
                                    <name>G450: Fault detected on Module Slot {#MODULE_SLOT}</name>
                                    <priority>HIGH</priority>
                                </trigger_prototype>
                            </trigger_prototypes>
                        </item_prototype>
                    </item_prototypes>
                </discovery_rule>

                <!-- LLD 2: VoIP Engine & DSP Resource Discovery -->
                <discovery_rule>
                    <uuid>ffffff1111114ffffff1111111111111</uuid>
                    <name>VoIP Engine Discovery</name>
                    <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                    <snmp_oid>discovery[{#VOIPSLOT},1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.4.5.1.1]</snmp_oid>
                    <key>cmgVoipEngineTable.discovery</key>
                    <delay>1h</delay>
                    <item_prototypes>
                        <!-- VoIP Fault Mask -->
                        <item_prototype>
                            <uuid>ffffff2222224ffffff2222222222222</uuid>
                            <name>VoIP Fault Mask Slot {#VOIPSLOT}</name>
                            <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                            <snmp_oid>1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.4.5.1.14.{#SNMPINDEX}</snmp_oid>
                            <key>VoipFaultMask_[{#VOIPSLOT}]</key>
                            <delay>1m</delay>
                            <value_type>TEXT</value_type>
                            <description>G450 VoIP Engine Fault Mask (cmgVoipEngineFaultMask).
Each bit set to '1' indicates a specific hardware/software fault in the VoIP DSP engine.

【説明】
VoIPメディアリソース（DSPチャネル）の内部障害ステータスを示す4オクテットのビットパターンです。
・正常値: "00 00 00 00" (全ビット0)
・左側（上位）オクテットほど深刻度の高い障害（DSP故障等）を示します。

【影響と対応】
値の変化時はVoIPチャネル障害（通話不能・片通話等）の可能性があるため、G450 CLI (`show voip-parameters`) で詳細を確認してください。</description>
                            <tags>
                                <tag><tag>component</tag><value>voip</value></tag>
                                <tag><tag>subsystem</tag><value>dsp</value></tag>
                            </tags>
                            <trigger_prototypes>
                                <trigger_prototype>
                                    <uuid>ffffff3333334ffffff3333333333333</uuid>
                                    <expression>find(/Avaya G450 Media Gateway/VoipFaultMask_[{#VOIPSLOT}],,"regexp","^(00[: ]?){3}00$")=0</expression>
                                    <recovery_mode>EXPRESSION</recovery_mode>
                                    <recovery_expression>find(/Avaya G450 Media Gateway/VoipFaultMask_[{#VOIPSLOT}],,"regexp","^(00[: ]?){3}00$")=1</recovery_expression>
                                    <name>G450: VoIP Engine Fault Detected (Slot {#VOIPSLOT})</name>
                                    <priority>HIGH</priority>
                                    <manual_close>YES</manual_close>
                                </trigger_prototype>
                            </trigger_prototypes>
                        </item_prototype>

                        <!-- VoIP Active Channels -->
                        <item_prototype>
                            <uuid>ffffff4444444ffffff4444444444444</uuid>
                            <name>VoIP Active Channels (Slot {#VOIPSLOT})</name>
                            <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                            <snmp_oid>1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.4.5.1.7.{#SNMPINDEX}</snmp_oid>
                            <key>cmgVoipActiveChannels[{#VOIPSLOT}]</key>
                            <delay>1m</delay>
                            <value_type>UINT64</value_type>
                            <units>ch</units>
                            <description>Currently Active Voice/Data Channels on VoIP Engine Slot {#VOIPSLOT} (cmgVoipActiveChannels).</description>
                            <tags>
                                <tag><tag>component</tag><value>voip</value></tag>
                            </tags>
                        </item_prototype>

                        <!-- VoIP Max Channels -->
                        <item_prototype>
                            <uuid>ffffff5555554ffffff5555555555555</uuid>
                            <name>VoIP Max Channels (Slot {#VOIPSLOT})</name>
                            <type>SNMP_AGENT</type>
                            <snmp_oid>1.3.6.1.4.1.6889.2.9.1.4.5.1.6.{#SNMPINDEX}</snmp_oid>
                            <key>cmgVoipMaxChannels[{#VOIPSLOT}]</key>
                            <delay>1h</delay>
                            <value_type>UINT64</value_type>
                            <units>ch</units>
                            <description>Maximum Available Channel Capacity on VoIP Engine Slot {#VOIPSLOT} (cmgVoipMaxChannels).</description>
                            <tags>
                                <tag><tag>component</tag><value>voip</value></tag>
                            </tags>
                        </item_prototype>

                        <!-- Calculated DSP Usage -->
                        <item_prototype>
                            <uuid>ffffff6666664ffffff6666666666666</uuid>
                            <name>VoIP DSP Usage (Slot {#VOIPSLOT})</name>
                            <type>CALCULATED</type>
                            <key>voip.dsp.usage[{#VOIPSLOT}]</key>
                            <delay>1m</delay>
                            <value_type>FLOAT</value_type>
                            <units>%</units>
                            <params>last(//cmgVoipActiveChannels[{#VOIPSLOT}]) / last(//cmgVoipMaxChannels[{#VOIPSLOT}]) * 100</params>
                            <description>Calculated VoIP DSP Channel Usage (%) for Slot {#VOIPSLOT}.
【影響】使用率が100%に達すると、新規発着信拒否や無音通話が発生します。</description>
                            <tags>
                                <tag><tag>component</tag><value>voip</value></tag>
                                <tag><tag>subsystem</tag><value>dsp</value></tag>
                            </tags>
                            <trigger_prototypes>
                                <trigger_prototype>
                                    <uuid>ffffff7777774ffffff7777777777777</uuid>
                                    <expression>min(/Avaya G450 Media Gateway/voip.dsp.usage[{#VOIPSLOT}],5m)&gt;85</expression>
                                    <name>G450: High VoIP DSP Usage on Slot {#VOIPSLOT} (&gt;85% for 5m)</name>
                                    <priority>WARNING</priority>
                                </trigger_prototype>
                                <trigger_prototype>
                                    <uuid>ffffff8888884ffffff8888888888888</uuid>
                                    <expression>last(/Avaya G450 Media Gateway/cmgVoipActiveChannels[{#VOIPSLOT}])&gt;=last(/Avaya G450 Media Gateway/cmgVoipMaxChannels[{#VOIPSLOT}])</expression>
                                    <name>G450: VoIP DSP Resources Exhausted on Slot {#VOIPSLOT} (100% Full)</name>
                                    <priority>HIGH</priority>
                                </trigger_prototype>
                            </trigger_prototypes>
                        </item_prototype>
                    </item_prototypes>
                </discovery_rule>
            </discovery_rules>

            <macros>
                <macro>
                    <macro>{$CPU_TEMP_WARN}</macro>
                    <value>60</value>
                </macro>
                <macro>
                    <macro>{$DSP_TEMP_WARN}</macro>
                    <value>60</value>
                </macro>
            </macros>
        </template>
    </templates>
</zabbix_export>